  "body": "Hello there,\r\n\r\nI'm using Synapse's latest version, and I have a question about static content. I need that the synapse server uploads the static content to s3 or digitaloceanspace when someone uploads a picture or voice record. I found https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse-s3-storage-provider and tried it. But it didn't work as I expected.\r\n\r\nI don't want to use local storage, just the CDN providers. is that possible now? Maybe I could use FUSE or something like that, but I want to save the traffic from the main servers. \r\n\r\nDo you have any suggestions?",
